| Field | Kind | Meaning |
| --- | --- | --- |
| \`id\` | id | Optional entry id. Keep ids you were given so entries can be matched later; never invent them. |
| \`name\` | text | Project name. |
| \`subtitle\` | text | Short tagline or role. |
| \`start\` | date | Start date. A date as "YYYY" or "YYYY-MM"; an end date still running is "present". Leave it out when unknown. |
